; ── Bench gate ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Compiles and runs every bench/*.march and checks its known answer. Nothing
; else in the suite ever compiled a benchmark, which is how a program-wide
; FBIP regression, two SIGBUS crashes and a non-terminating drain loop all
; survived. Deliberately checks ANSWERS, never wall-clock, so it cannot be
; flaky on a loaded machine.
;
; Own alias, not `runtest`: it compiles ~26 native binaries (~45s cold, much
; less warm via the CAS artifact cache). Run it with
;   dune build @test/bench_gate
