; hoist_fallback_jp exists to prevent for fallbacks.
; The `classify` / `classify_guarded` / `message` arms additionally pin the
; scoping fix: an arm may contain an or-pattern AND bind names elsewhere, and
; those binders live inside the decision tree while the join-point closure is
