; ── Regression: the crash trap must restore the actor record's refcount that
; the dispatch loop clobbers to 1 for FBIP.  march_panic's longjmp used to
; skip that restore, leaving a live, multiply-owned record claiming a single
; owner — so the next drop by any other owner freed it and everything after
; was a use-after-free (seen as EXC_BAD_ACCESS inside an unrelated malloc).
; Asserts the RC directly (via the ffi_test_actor_rc probe in march_ffi.c),
; because every March-level symptom of the bug is undefined behavior.
