; js_self_tail_call_rc_drop — a self-recursive tail call whose Cons-branch
; drops a heap-allocated (RC'd) binding it never read must still return its
; own value, not `undefined`. Perceus keeps self-tail-calls in the shape
; ESeq(call, EDecRC(dead_var)...) so llvm_emit.ml's TCO pass can recognize
; and rewrite them; the JS backend has no such rewrite and was emitting the
; call as a bare (unreturned) statement, discarding its result.
(rule
 (targets js_self_tail_call_rc_drop.mjs)
