; Separate fixture: the map2 inline loop's own length-mismatch check
; (native_arr_map2_check_len) must panic identically to the non-inlined
; native_int_arr_map2/native_float_arr_map2 functions' check, since the
; inline path bypasses those entirely. Kept out of the correctness fixture
